<section xml:id="mhash.installation" xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
 &reftitle.install;
 <simpara>
  You need to compile PHP with the
  <option role="configure">--with-mhash</option> parameter to enable
  this extension.
 </simpara>
 <simpara>
  The mhash functions are provided by the <link linkend="ref.hash">Hash</link>
  extension, which is always available. The
  <option role="configure">--with-mhash</option> option is deprecated as of
  PHP 8.1.0 and emits a warning at configure time.
 </simpara>
</section>

